{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：21:08 2026-11-25 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"伍富橋遭富貴老婆梁兆楹連環爆粗狙擊  「億萬駙馬」被直斥「戇X」  正面回應身家懸殊\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b927138612f94d198268b404ff7fcbac/2026-11/KF_-_2026-11-25T225045_372.png\"/>\n<p>歌手伍富橋（Alvin）與富家千金梁兆楹（Shirley）於今年10月喜迎愛兒 Julian，正式晉升為新手爸媽。近日，這對剛迎來新生命的小夫妻攜手作客網台清談節目《男人萬歲》，大談相識相愛經過。豈料真性情的梁兆楹於錄影期間幽默爆粗，更踢爆當年是自己「倒追」男方，直接公開平日不為人知的真實相處點滴。</p>\n<h2>梁兆楹大方承認倒追</h2>\n<p>節目中，當主持問起兩人「邊個追邊個先」時，梁兆楹隨即展現爽朗本色，親口證實：「我想佢一開始應該覺得係我approach佢。」她更笑指伍富橋顧及面子，對外一直宣稱是自己主動追求女方。坐在一旁的伍富橋非但沒有黑面，反而全程面帶笑容，尷尬又甜蜜地笑稱當初確實自我感覺良好，曾想過「係咪自己都生得挺不錯呢？」引來全場主持起鬨。</p>\n<img alt=\"伍富橋婚後大減工作量。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/322f300ecc5a80206a8b19d33ed7cdb4/2025-12/NG_4_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"伍富橋於2022年與富家女梁兆楹結婚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/689061b2f503f2b25fd611ee9955d13c/2024-05/sysleungx_1715170042_3363412552893182041_6235759.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"伍富橋婚後生活無憂。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1a02123fb7bc3ec35dce92d4cbd35d6a/2023-11/alvinngfukiu_1683477655_3097557538644450406_1281426289.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"伍富就快結婚4年。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3988fb1addb66a5026970f33a3109386/2024-10/441112127_1344951736180869_2877843930581810894_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"伍富橋太太梁兆楹年初在IG限時動態出PO，意外曝光已經懷孕。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/32cbc7fb8c67a6c2c2503893bd6454e8/2026-04/NG_6_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"伍富橋在IG報喜，公開胎兒的超聲波照片。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/98e156848efc7d8e56e6faecd8186268/2026-04/alvinngfukiu_1777107503_3882980487136948471_1281426289.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"伍富橋留言表示：「最近接咗單大工程，預計10月完工。到時見啦，伍梁液。」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8633870429e5b83762d90c8c69895375/2026-04/alvinngfukiu_1777107503_3882980483110455737_1281426289.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"伍富橋透露太太梁兆楹懷孕喜訊，原計劃5月8日結婚4周年才公開。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5f4aace1553cb4b3fb1fcdc1e7b04e3a/2026-04/NG_4_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"伍富橋向傳媒大方承認即將榮升爸爸。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7891a9010d508befaff468e23e2da678/2026-04/NG_2_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"伍富橋早前在凌晨4時跳舞慰妻。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d0afc45d4974de75e8577380ed653378/2026-04/NG_9__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"伍富橋婚後入住千呎豪宅。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/52f621420c300fad4c5d645e12b1f8a0/2024-06/alvinngfukiu_1717084034_3379468283391299045_1281426289.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"伍富橋身後的Bearbrick牆是太太的玩具。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/171adf1b6ef7cae5d2544d7843a27706/2024-02/alvinngfukiu_1707565803_3299623570660855872_1281426289.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"伍富橋曾分享室內環境。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/119453da4d3f134f66ae44e06d3a1c0f/2024-06/harlei226_1718568286_3391919091215896656_67468016952.jpg\"/>\n<h2>梁兆楹激動爆粗展真性情</h2>\n<p>談到雙方在健身房結緣的經歷，伍富橋自稱當時是「出於一片義氣」義務充當其私人教練。此話一出，隨即引來梁兆楹直率爆粗反擊：「X你！我有畀錢買堂㗎，你出咩義氣！」梁兆楹 坦言，初相識時覺得男方的行為舉止十分「on9」（戇X），甚至分享秘密心事時的舉動很「核突」。她笑稱當年曾仗義當軍師幫男方搭配服裝去追其他女仔，結果追求失敗，被主持笑指她當年根本是「幫倒忙」掃走情敵。</p>\n<h2>伍富橋回應身家懸殊</h2>\n<p>面對老婆在節目中的連環拆穿與幽默狙擊，被外界冠以「億萬駙馬」稱號的伍富橋全程表現大方，毫無慍色。談到外界一直關注的財富差距與冷言冷語，他在節目預告中親自給予正面回應，拋出金句直言：「婚都結埋啦，相親相愛咪好囉！」以樂觀與豁達的態度，展現出兩人深厚的感情基礎。</p>\n<h2>梁兆楹家族資產過億</h2>\n<p>伍富橋與太太梁兆楹結婚近4年來非常恩愛，曾曝光西貢相思灣5,000呎豪宅，二人又不時到外地旅行，經常形影不離在社交平台放閃，大晒美滿婚姻生活。有指伍富橋的外父有兩間麻將館，身家逾億。伍富橋近年減少在幕前演出，忙於打理在上環的2,000呎健身及物理治療中心，並親自任教。</p>\n<img alt=\"伍富橋曾公開5,000呎大屋的平面圖及照片。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b850d3a0fbcbbf35e33c540c652997b1/2024-02/20_12.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"客廳好大。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5142ba9de701e9d3b1fe3b61dcaedf1d/2024-02/21_17.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"裝潢好氣派。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e037f59418fdd7a678376c6235220c68/2024-02/23_13.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"伍富橋太太拍攝豪宅大花園。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/913fa99daea1db1a2e89ff92784c8c51/2026-04/NG_7_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"見到有一個長方形泳池。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/47c2d4703fcf06ad88ca15c9199eed42/2026-04/NG_8_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"伍富橋與老婆梁兆楹一向恩愛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/19838be89e0f22604f72eb28cf6da226/2024-06/14936416-9196-4df5-83db-c0e284b6268cA.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蛋糕上有伍富橋的英文名Alvin。​\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cf7fd63da913565a05457b05cf8e35bb/2024-06/3fcd8d0a-dda4-4d2f-b501-43bba7343eabA.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"伍富橋生日曾收到自訂車牌。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2b6fa4460caee88265b56e411d13c136/2024-06/VS--ShirleyLeungsysleungxInstagram-0_35_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁兆楹親自為老公伍富橋的黃色保時捷換上車牌。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9342730b9bb3c7d3ee655bda69bc083f/2024-06/VS--ShirleyLeungsysleungxInstagram-0_56_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"伍富橋收到自訂「623」車牌時，表現十分開心。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c9c56efd2014e2ff43e4e222dfbe5619/2024-06/VS--ShirleyLeungsysleungxInstagram-1_21_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"伍富橋對傳出離巢，指自己還有基本藝人合約。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2eb76122e2a2001625d463a83514edab/2025-12/NG_8_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"伍富橋曾被官方網頁除名，自嘲可能合約太過基本。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ca8e50fb035282ee25214490025648da/2025-12/NG_9_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"伍富橋被「除名」後，官方網頁已重新見到再出現在藝人名單。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dbca397ee0ea45587af5d27b4763e57e/2025-12/2443_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"伍富橋與梁兆楹去年為慶祝結婚三周年，拍攝一輯全新婚紗相。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/66aae72c26aeca2e2111900d83850764/2025-05/WhatsApp_Image_2025-05-06_at_10_12_02_PM_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"伍富橋與梁兆楹的3周年婚紗相，一絲不苟。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/08cc8cdc918ed6c9835984bd0cf07d08/2025-05/WhatsApp_Image_2025-05-06_at_10_12_08_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"伍富橋與梁兆楹的婚紗相，有歐洲童話氣息。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/69c3e96e902923534723a321a8924594/2025-05/WhatsApp_Image_2025-05-06_at_10_12_07_PM_3_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"伍富橋夫婦挑選歐洲風格。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/16327de9d5f9ffe28f500c9063994e0b/2025-05/WhatsApp_Image_2025-05-06_at_10_12_07_PM_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"伍富橋富貴妻梁兆楹的婚紗好典雅。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/ff98d5c631445348605642109c80286a/2025-05/WhatsApp_Image_2025-05-06_at_10_12_07_PM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁兆楹與伍富橋有如再辦一場婚禮。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/82abcba9c9f75030b0cd203d36c78379/2025-05/WhatsApp_Image_2025-05-06_at_10_12_07_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"伍富橋擁抱太太梁兆楹。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/10b0700b320e7f8b1d72b6732705d20e/2025-05/WhatsApp_Image_2025-05-06_at_10_12_06_PM_3_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"伍富橋太太梁兆楹換上另一款婚紗。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d9ec1b311f9f29e2e04831a23ff555ab/2025-05/WhatsApp_Image_2025-05-06_at_10_12_06_PM_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁兆楹的婚紗以一字肩設計。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/21fae70b937c210f9d8a0569190f1906/2025-05/WhatsApp_Image_2025-05-06_at_10_12_06_PM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"伍富橋與太太梁兆楹在綠悠悠的背景下拍照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ad30d3031836b6ba584a011085fbd87d/2025-05/WhatsApp_Image_2025-05-06_at_10_12_05_PM_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"伍富橋與太太梁兆楹的婚照，畫面非常好看。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cdaa32d152827bdee6853cfcb8711f93/2025-05/WhatsApp_Image_2025-05-06_at_10_12_06_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"伍富橋與太太梁兆楹有如置身婚禮現場。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8f04eef8c70a3556672eee4bf867f6b5/2025-05/WhatsApp_Image_2025-05-06_at_10_12_05_PM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁兆楹與伍富橋在相中非常甜蜜。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/17f60cf5dff62e6432ddbe0dc4b965fa/2025-05/WhatsApp_Image_2025-05-06_at_10_12_05_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁兆楹與伍富橋婚後經歷不少風雨。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/35784a2a367e372f89d0059094bdaec8/2025-05/WhatsApp_Image_2025-05-06_at_10_12_04_PM_3_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"伍富橋準備鑽戒。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dbc085f7d3d2cb0b94f07082640584b1/2025-05/WhatsApp_Image_2025-05-06_at_10_12_04_PM_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"伍富橋的西裝下疑真空上陣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/69fa2ce9eba7b8b47de87276f9abcd80/2025-05/WhatsApp_Image_2025-05-06_at_10_12_04_PM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"伍富橋與梁兆楹為慶祝結婚周年花心思。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4d033e4ff4f2dbbf98de05f3f57b4ceb/2025-05/WhatsApp_Image_2025-05-06_at_10_12_04_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁兆楹在相中形象大變，優雅且散發氣質。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/be3940789cd0fea785a914f2cf7ec177/2025-05/WhatsApp_Image_2025-05-06_at_10_12_03_PM.jpeg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T15:03:57.946117+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":825,"images":45,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T13:08:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T21:49:39.634664+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T14:57:29.199551+00:00","content_hash":"d0c2221fca386f2a302d5928b05a7026c2d47b3d289225d3b20b25be66772588","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}